@using ContosoUniversity.Security
@* Anti-XSS: Razor HTML-encodes all output by default. Do not use Html.Raw()/HtmlString on untrusted data.
   When HTML must be rendered, pass it through the Ganss.Xss-backed sanitizer first
   (allow-list policy is sourced from AWS Secrets Manager). *@
@inject IHtmlSanitizerService Sanitizer
